cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use fly, please cite it by its DOI, 10.5281/zenodo.23432896.
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'fly: Historic Airphoto Footprints, Selection and Georeferencing for British
  Columbia'
version: 0.24.1
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23432896
abstract: Estimate the ground a historic British Columbia airphoto covers from its
  catalogue record; given an elevation model, a film photo can be sized from the aircraft's
  height above the ground, with the catalogued flying height checked against the photo
  scale. Select a small set of photos covering an area of interest, download thumbnails
  and flight metadata from the BC Data Catalogue, and georeference scans onto their
  estimated footprints.
